# Optional. The contact form already sends real emails out of the box via
# FormSubmit, straight to contact@sarathilabs.com — no setup required.
# See src/components/ContactForm.jsx (RECIPIENT_EMAIL) to change that inbox,
# or set VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT here to override with a different provider
# entirely (Formspree, EmailJS, your own serverless function, etc).
#
# Any endpoint that accepts a POST with JSON fields (name, email, company,
# message) and returns a 2xx status will work as a drop-in replacement.

# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
